# Context is the umbrella root; keep the giant local trees out of the daemon
# upload. node_modules must NOT ship into the context: the image runs its own
# frozen-lockfile installs (host node_modules may carry another OS's natives).
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.git
**/target
prover-node/zkvm/build
prover-node/zkvm/target
web2-api/web/.next
web2-api/web/out
web2-api/server/data
web3-protocol/contracts/cache
web3-protocol/circuits/cache
book
outputs
output
qa
tmp
.tools
.claude
**/*.log
**/test-results
**/gpu-*-evidence
